From 046b7f18f57ea2a40bb4443ebac3bd85155f6d60 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: alex-PT78 <alex@example.com>
Date: Sat, 12 Sep 2026 22:45:08 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] Add Razer Huntsman V3 X TKL (02B1) support, rebased on
 upstream v3.12.1

- Add USB ID 0x02B1 in razerkbd_driver.h, udev, README
- Mirror BlackWidow V4 X protocol (report 0x02, 0x1F/0x3F/0xFF as appropriate)
- Fix game_led_state fallthrough bug (uninitialized request)
- Fix daemon EVENT_FILE_REGEX NK/TKL -> Tenkeyless, add optional if01
- Use _RippleKeyboard with full METHODS (wheel/game/macro/ripple) and WAVE_DIRS
- MATRIX_DIMS [6,18] for TKL layout
- Add fake driver cfg for tests
---
